## 2. `nursery.rs` module registration

**`/workspace/repo/crates/biome_js_analyze/src/lint/nursery.rs`** (full, 55 lines). Two edits per rule — a `pub mod` (alphabetical) and an entry in `declare_group!`:
```rust
