```
`NoMisplacedAssertion` sorts alphabetically: `pub mod no_misplaced_assertion;` goes between `no_focused_tests` and `no_namespace_import` (line ~13); the group entry `self :: no_misplaced_assertion :: NoMisplacedAssertion ,` goes at the matching position.

