## 3. Diagnostic category registration

**`/workspace/repo/crates/biome_diagnostics_categories/src/categories.rs`**. Uses a `define_categories! {` macro (opens line 15). Header comment (lines 10-13) states: rules are lexicographically sorted and must sit between `define_categories! {\n` and `\n    ;\n`. Nursery block is lines 109-135, e.g.:
