**`/workspace/repo/crates/biome_service/src/configuration/linter/rules.rs`**. Imports (lines 1-16) include `use biome_js_analyze::options::*;` (line 11), so the `NoMisplacedAssertion` alias is in scope automatically. The `Nursery` struct is lines 2552-2628; `impl Nursery` is 2643-3099.

